<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Aid Undead</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Necromancer (guild level 60)
Mana: 10
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast aid undead &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast aid undead</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>The necromancer prays to all evil over one of the undead, and gives it 
back some of its strength. The undead don't rest and recover as the living 
do, so they tire and lose endurance quickly; this prayer restores 
endurance, more the better your divine power and sphere, up to some 
seventy points for a master. Demons and devils are aided too; on the 
living, nothing happens.
</p><p>It is a way to keep your undead servants going. You must be standing, and 
no free hands are needed. It is also found on potions and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Animate Dead</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Repel Lesser Undead</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Divine Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>